{"n":3,"title":"PIN codes, prices & phone numbers","blurb":"Использовать числа 0–100","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"PIN codes, prices & phone numbers","sub":"","html":"<p>Числа, которые ты вводишь каждый день — и как считать вещи.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Использовать числа 0–100</li><li>Называть свой возраст</li><li>Называть и понимать номер телефона</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Выберите числа, которые вы уже знаете.","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"one"},{"label":"five"},{"label":"ten"},{"label":"twenty"},{"label":"fifty"},{"label":"a hundred"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"one · 1","pos":"","ru":"один","kk":"бір","def":"One coffee, please.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/b7b868c13af2.mp3"},{"en":"two · 2","pos":"","ru":"два","kk":"екі","def":"I have two phones.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/f4f258009238.mp3"},{"en":"three · 3","pos":"","ru":"три","kk":"үш","def":"Three keys.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/2f05f0c7e6f5.mp3"},{"en":"four · 4","pos":"","ru":"четыре","kk":"төрт","def":"Four books.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/a531fc0f3506.mp3"},{"en":"five · 5","pos":"","ru":"пять","kk":"бес","def":"Five pens.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/946f71634c8e.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"six · 6","pos":"","ru":"шесть","kk":"алты","def":"Six pens.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/e988a343b53e.mp3"},{"en":"seven · 7","pos":"","ru":"семь","kk":"жеті","def":"Seven days.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/5b0a3fc219e4.mp3"},{"en":"eight · 8","pos":"","ru":"восемь","kk":"сегіз","def":"Eight books.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/9ce4289cc8d4.mp3"},{"en":"nine · 9","pos":"","ru":"девять","kk":"тоғыз","def":"Nine bags.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/23621cc045e2.mp3"},{"en":"ten · 10","pos":"","ru":"десять","kk":"он","def":"Ten phones.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/3cc863ce5859.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"note","title":"13 или 30?","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>-teen</th><th>-ty</th></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>thirteen · 13</td><td>thirty · 30</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>fourteen · 14</td><td>forty · 40</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>sixteen · 16</td><td>sixty · 60</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>eighteen · 18</td><td>eighty · 80</td></tr></table><p><b>-teen</b> — это 13–19. <b>-ty</b> — 30, 40, 50…</p><p>В словах на <b>-teen</b> ударение в конце: thir<b>teen</b>.</p><p>В словах на <b>-ty</b> ударение в начале: <b>thir</b>ty.</p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">a hundred = 100.</p>"},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите число, которое вы слышите.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/01fc7717eceb.mp3","prompt":"","options":["13","30","3"],"answer":"30","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите число, которое вы слышите.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/c5ec2965af71.mp3","prompt":"","options":["40","4","14"],"answer":"14","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите число, которое вы слышите.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/c4e59cbd8997.mp3","prompt":"","options":["16","60","6"],"answer":"16","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Выберите число, которое вы слышите.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/07ac93e96ee3.mp3","before":"","after":"","answers":["80"],"bank":["80","18","8"]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите число, которое вы слышите.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/8deecb3fbe3d.mp3","prompt":"","options":["9","90","19"],"answer":"90","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cols","title":"Распределите слова по колонкам.","sub":"","columns":["13 – 19","20 – 90"],"items":[{"text":"seventy","col":1},{"text":"ninety","col":